        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> alexcrichton created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14796#discussion_r4307999434\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Can this use the <code>precise-output</code> mode to get the full golden output listed here?</p>\n</blockquote>",
