    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> alexcrichton created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14796#discussion_r4308003366\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Could this perhaps have rules for <code>$I16</code> as well since it seems equally applicable? Also -- are you sure this doesn't need to extend the <code>x</code> and <code>y</code> arguments appropriately? I forget the rules around multiplication and bits so I'm not sure myself</p>\n</blockquote>",
